# Title: Remote Access Tool - RURAT Execution From Unusual Location
# ID: e01fa958-6893-41d4-ae03-182477c5e77d
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-19
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects execution of Remote Utilities RAT (RURAT) from an unusual location (outside of 'C:\Program Files')
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.executable:*\\rutserv.exe OR process.executable:*\\rfusclient.exe)) OR (Product:"Remote Utilities")) AND NOT (((process.executable:C:\\Program Files\\Remote Utilities* OR process.executable:C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Remote Utilities*))))
